[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9062.07, "timestamp": "02:31:02", "text": "这确实是一件非常令人作呕的事情，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9063.349, "timestamp": "02:31:03", "text": "你觉得什么东西很恶心？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9065.429, "timestamp": "02:31:05", "text": "我年纪不小了吧？我很成熟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9067.51, "timestamp": "02:31:07", "text": "这件事。目前，我并非"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9069.51, "timestamp": "02:31:09", "text": "会说，我16岁，或者我20岁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9071.429, "timestamp": "02:31:11", "text": "或者我19岁，随便吧。我要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9073.27, "timestamp": "02:31:13", "text": "反对一切。我认识一个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9075.59, "timestamp": "02:31:15", "text": "那些已经走到这一步的人，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9076.87, "timestamp": "02:31:16", "text": "你看，这里人很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9078.55, "timestamp": "02:31:18", "text": "世界如此之大，你却一无所知。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9080.07, "timestamp": "02:31:20", "text": "如果你开始责怪所有人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9082.389, "timestamp": "02:31:22", "text": "你针对所有人，呃，什么都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9086.07, "timestamp": "02:31:26", "text": "左倾而非仇恨。嗯，你知道，当我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9089.11, "timestamp": "02:31:29", "text": "看看那东西，嗯，我的意思是，我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9090.469, "timestamp": "02:31:30", "text": "奇怪的理论。我不知道人们是怎么想的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9091.83, "timestamp": "02:31:31", "text": "会接受这一点，而且可能还会接受什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9093.59, "timestamp": "02:31:33", "text": "人们会因为我而讨厌我，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9096.15, "timestamp": "02:31:36", "text": "我明白她的意图，但我并不明白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9099.11, "timestamp": "02:31:39", "text": "我知道，但如果你看看那方面的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9101.99, "timestamp": "02:31:41", "text": "感觉它像某种肮脏的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9104.15, "timestamp": "02:31:44", "text": "你说这话的时候感觉很脏，因为它不是脏话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9111.03, "timestamp": "02:31:51", "text": "也是一部很棒的作品。所以对我来说，我的意思是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9112.71, "timestamp": "02:31:52", "text": "不知道。我在一个地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9114.55, "timestamp": "02:31:54", "text": "我认为不同之处在于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9115.83, "timestamp": "02:31:55", "text": "有很多事情是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9117.99, "timestamp": "02:31:57", "text": "那里正在发生什么？人民拥有人民"}]